   "en": "Oh, it's...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Hello, everyone.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Why are you here?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_003_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Is something wrong?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "You're going to fight Dr. Maruki, yes?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "...Please, take me with you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Uh, but... You can't go in dressed like[n]that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Please? I'm done running away.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "I can't keep relying on people, like[n][fName]-senpai...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "I want to live life as Sumire!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Heh, color me impressed.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Looks like she'll do just fine here.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Time to team up.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's do this.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Thank you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "In that case, we gotta come up with[n]a code name for you!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "A what now?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "It wouldn't be right if you were the[n]only one goin' by your real name,[n]y'know?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Oh, you're right!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Morgana",
   "en": "Joker, got any suggestions?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Leotard.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Violet.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Appetite.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "They often say that names and natures[n]are in harmony... That's a pretty deep[n]code name.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Is it?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_028_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Then, how about \"Violet\"? It's \"Sumire\"[n]in English!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Oh, that's right! \"Sumire\" in English is[n]\"Violet\"... Yeah, that sounds awesome!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "That seems a bit, ah...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Senpai... Even I get full from time to time.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_032_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "Uh, that's not really the issue...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_033_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ann",
   "en": "Then, how about \"Violet\"? It's \"Sumire\"[n]in English!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "\"Violet\"...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_034_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Yes, let's go with that!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_035_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Excellent! Now remember everyone,[n]\"Violet\"! Not \"Violent,\" \"Violet\"!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_036_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Yes, thank you for clarifying!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_037_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Akechi",
   "en": "I'm surrounded by absolute fools...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_037_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Akechi",
   "en": "Are we done? We should probably[n]get moving.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_038_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Ryuji",
   "en": "I know, I know. Geez! C'mon, Violet—[n]let's roll!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_039_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sumire",
   "en": "Yeah!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
